Error: 未知命令 'pte_is_invalid'
Usage: isarch [options] <command> [args]
Commands:
list-instructions                    List all available instructions
tree <instruction>                   Show execution path tree
solve-state [--clause|--extension|--instruction-name|--all]
Solve for concrete ISA state values

solve-state filters:
--clause <name>                      Specify clause(s) to execute (repeatable)
--extension <ext>                    Specify extension (i, m, c, etc.) (repeatable)
--instruction-name <name>            Specify assembly instruction name (repeatable)
--all                                Execute all clauses

Options:


Options:
    -T, --threads <n>   use this many worker threads
    -A, --arch <file>   load architecture file
    -C, --config <file> load custom config for architecture
        --toolchain <name>
                        use specified toolchain from config
    -R, --register <register>=<value>
                        set a register, via the reset_registers builtin
    -I, --initial <register>=<value>
                        set a register in the initial state
    -h, --help          print this help message
        --verbose       print verbose output
    -D, --debug <flags> set debugging flags
        --probe <id>    trace specified function calls or location assignments
                        in debug output
        --probe-all     probe everything (very verbose)
        --probe-function <id>
                        probe everything under the specified function (very
                        verbose)
        --trace-function <id>
                        trace specified function calls in the trace output
        --trace-all     trace everything
    -L, --linearize <id>
                        rewrite function into linear form
    -P, --partial-linearize <id>
                        rewrite function into linear form
    -S, --source <path> directory containing the Sail source used to generate
                        the IR
        --test-linearize 
                        test that linearization rewrite has been performed
                        correctly
        --abstract <id> make function abstract
        --debug-id <name id>
                        print the name of an interned identifier (for
                        debugging)
        --reset-constraint <constraint>
                        property to enforce at the reset_registers builtin
        --fork-assertions 
                        change assertions into explicit control flow
        --fun-assumption <assumption>
                        add an assumption about the behaviour of a Sail
                        function
        --no-model-reg-init 
                        don't use register initializers from the model
        --tastic <name> 指定 Z3 tactic（默认 default）
        --version       print out version and stop.
        --init-isa-with-config 
                        使用配置默认值初始化ISA
    -g, --graphviz      输出 Graphviz 格式
        --timeout <n[s|m|h]>
                        超时时间，默认秒；支持 s/m/h 后缀
        --smt-timeout <n[s|m|h]>
                        单次 Z3 operation 的 soft interrupt 超时时间
        --timeout-smt-output <destinations>
                        timeout SMT2 输出目标，逗号分隔：file,stdout,itrace
        --timeout-smt-dir <path>
                        timeout SMT2 文件输出目录
        --execution-limits-config <path>
                        加载独立的执行限制 TOML 配置
        --clause <name> 指定要符号执行的clause名
        --extension <ext>
                        指定扩展名（如 i, m, c）
        --instruction-name <name>
                        指定指令汇编名称
        --instruction-bits <0xNNNN|0xNNNNNNNN>
                        定向执行真实16/32位编码（需单一--clause）
        --prestate <reg>=<value>
                        定向固定完整顶层寄存器初态（需单一--clause）
        --encoding-slices-config <file>
                        加载编码分片 TOML（[[encoding_slices]]，叠加到 -C
                        配置之上）
        --all           执行所有clause
        --path-merging  启用运行时动态路径合并 (Veritesting)
        --itrace <path> 把指令执行轨迹写入文件
